OL,3,GNEWSA'Here's looking at you, kid' - a
OL,4,Aheartbreak history
OL,5,
OL,6,FFrom Rick and Ilsa's final farewell in
OL,7,FCasablanca to Adele singing Someone
OL,8,FLike You - heartbreak has been at the
OL,9,Fheart of popular culture for much of
OL,10,Fthe last century.
OL,12,FBut the pain is just about as old as
OL,13,Fhuman's themselves. For thousands of
OL,14,Fyears it has provided inspiration for
OL,15,Ftales of woe and even cause for medical
OL,16,Fenquiries.
