OL,3,GNEWSA'Here's looking at you, kid' - a
OL,4,Aheartbreak history
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new exhibition in Oxford is
OL,7,Fattempting to chart some of that
OL,8,Fhistory - tracing back to uncover how
OL,9,Fpeople in the past valued, expressed,
OL,10,Fand tried to recover from the anguish
OL,11,Fof heartbreak.
OL,13,FAfter Love, at the OVADA Gallery in the
OL,14,Fcity centre, has been compiled and
OL,15,Forganised by Sally Holloway, who is a a
OL,16,Fhistorian of emotions at the University
OL,17,Fof Warwick.
